# React / Next.js

- App Router only. Server Components by default; add `"use client"` only when interactivity requires it.
- Never import server-only code (DB clients, `src/lib/meta`, secrets) from `"use client"` files. Never pass secrets through props.
- Never call the Meta API from client components. All model calls go through server use cases.
- Hooks at top level only, in the same order every render. Keep `react-hooks/rules-of-hooks` clean and justify any `exhaustive-deps` suppression.
- Derive state during render. Reserve `useEffect` for external systems (subscriptions, listeners) with cleanup.
- Pair every `Suspense` boundary with an error boundary. Place boundaries close to the data.
- Every async surface needs loading, empty, error, and success states.
- Style with Tailwind 4 + shadcn/ui + Motion + Lucide, using `docs/DESIGN.md` tokens. No new visual library.
- A11y basics: semantic roles, labels on inputs, keyboard-reachable controls, visible focus, `alt` text.
- Sessions use httpOnly cookies in `src/lib/session`. Never store sessions in `localStorage`.
- Sanitize any raw HTML. Validate `href` schemes. Add `rel="noopener noreferrer"` to `target="_blank"`.
